 96→ * @param params.itemType - 'folder' or 'file'
 97→ * @param params.ipnsName - IPNS name of the shared item
 98→ * @param params.itemName - Display name of the shared item
 99→ * @param params.encryptedKey - Hex-encoded ECIES ciphertext of the item key
100→ * @param params.childKeys - Optional re-wrapped descendant keys
